  "finalReply": "Done. Created `primers.fasta` with 8 primers (4 pairs, minimum: one pair per template since no internal BsaI sites were found in `input`, `egfp`, `flag`, or `snap`).\n\nDesign:\n- Type IIS BsaI sites face inward (`GGTCTC` on each primer 5'→3') so sites are lost after digestion.\n- Each primer tail: `TTAT` (4 nt extra 5' of site for NEB BsaI-HFv2 efficient cleavage near ends) + `GGTCTC` + `A` spacer (for 1/5 cut) + 4-nt overhang.\n- Overhangs tiling `output` junctions:\n  - J1 vector→egfp: `ATGA` (210-213), revcomp `TCAT`\n  - J2 egfp→flag: `AGGT` (923-926), revcomp `ACCT`\n  - J3 flag→snap: `TCAG` (1005-1008), revcomp `CTGA`\n  - J4 snap→vector: `AATG` (1552-1555), revcomp `CATT`\n  - All distinct, non-palindromic, pairwise ≥2 mismatches, reconstructs `output` seamlessly with start/stop codons correctly removed/retained.\n- Annealing (Tm by `oligotm -tp 1 -sc 1 -mv 50 -dv 2 -n 0.8 -d 500`):\n  - `input_fwd` 17nt `AGGATCCCGGGAATTCT` 58.12°C / `input_rev` 28nt `ATGTATATCTCCTTCTTAAAGTTAAACA` 58.08°C Δ0.03\n  - `egfp_fwd` 15nt `GCAAGGGCGAGGAGC` 61.69°C / `egfp_rev` 19nt `TTGTACAGCTCGTCCATGC` 61.76°C Δ0.07\n  - `flag_fwd` 15nt `AGTGGCTCCGGTAGC` 59.15°C / `flag_rev` 19nt `ACCACTACCTGAACCAGAA` 59.17°C Δ0.02\n  - `snap_fwd` 21nt `ACAAAGACTGCGAAATGAAGC` 61.30°C / `snap_rev` 15nt `AACCCAGCCCAGGCT` 61.81°C Δ0.50\n  - All 15-36nt (within 15-45), all 58-72°C, all pairs ≤5°C.\n- File has 16 lines, no blank lines.",
